      "message": "level-triggered interrupt (reset by status read) would be more robust, but it\u0027s too much overhead for now (since on the EC side cannot read the status over i2c in interrupt context)\nProbably worth re-discussing together the use cases to check what would be the best option.",
      "revId": "c9e96de0305a992fd4251658dfa076d6ab64b82f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
