      "message": "maybe we want to set -1 (and defined batt_soc as signed) to possibly differentiate the drained battery from no battery response.\n\nIn the past, for drained battery detection, the remaining energy (mWh) has proven a more useful metric than charge percent because it\u0027s finer grained (1 mWh \u003c\u003c 1%)",
      "revId": "c9e96de0305a992fd4251658dfa076d6ab64b82f",
